# <type>(<scope>): <short imperative summary>   (max 72 chars, English only)
#
# Allowed types: feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | chore | build | ci | perf | style
# Example:
#   feat(radar): add WeChat channel jobs to the job library
#
# Body: explain WHAT changed and WHY (not how). Wrap at 72 chars.
# Keep the subject imperative, with no trailing period.
#
# Footer (optional): Closes #123 / Refs #123 / BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# ------------------------------ >8 ------------------------------
# Everything below the scissors line is ignored by git.
# REMINDER: issues, PRs and commit messages must be written in English.
